i. all costs Directly Attributable to Non-Power Unit Activities; and ii. if the Power Unit Manufacturer can prove to the satisfaction of the Cost Cap Administration that an identifiable portion of the following costs relates to Non-Power Unit Activities, that portion of those costs:

